The documents under data/ are unmodified copies fetched by scripts/fetch_corpus.py and are
listed with their sha256 in data/MANIFEST.json.

* data/eips/eip-*.md        ethereum/EIPs            https://github.com/ethereum/EIPs
* data/eips/erc-*.md        ethereum/ERCs            https://github.com/ethereum/ERCs
* data/consensus-specs/*.md ethereum/consensus-specs https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs

